1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 16=

4
00:00:59,150 --> 00:00:59,960
Xiaoyuan.

5
00:01:00,430 --> 00:01:01,640
You're still protecting him.

6
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,040
You've been reborn too?

7
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,400
Yes.

8
00:01:07,710 --> 00:01:08,790
I've returned,

9
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,710
with all my memories
of the last lifetime,

10
00:01:11,150 --> 00:01:12,430
when you fled on your wedding night

11
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,640
and chose Boqing over me.

12
00:01:17,230 --> 00:01:18,040
Your Highness,

13
00:01:18,430 --> 00:01:18,870
I...

14
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:21,120
When I saw you
visit him at Qingyan Palace,

15
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:21,790
I knew

16
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,640
you'd been reborn too.

17
00:01:24,790 --> 00:01:25,640
But in this lifetime,

18
00:01:25,870 --> 00:01:27,000
he doesn't remember you.

19
00:01:29,590 --> 00:01:30,350
Your Highness,

20
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:33,070
since you already know

21
00:01:33,310 --> 00:01:34,680
my heart belongs to someone else...

22
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,040
I don't care.

23
00:01:37,870 --> 00:01:38,680
Xiaoyuan.

24
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:40,400
My feelings for you are sincere.

25
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:42,480
I can't watch you run to Boqing
when he's lost his memory

26
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,200
and is even plotting to kill you.

27
00:01:44,870 --> 00:01:46,790
(How does he know
Zhao Boqing wants to kill me?)

28
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,840
(Then what about Zhao Boqing's
plan to seize the throne?)

29
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:52,200
Boqing lost his mother when he was young

30
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,350
and has always kept to himself.

31
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,950
Now he has no feelings for you either.

32
00:01:55,230 --> 00:01:56,400
If he still had his memories,

33
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,760
I could step aside.

34
00:01:59,230 --> 00:02:00,200
But he doesn't.

35
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:02,350
If you insist on getting close to him,

36
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,760
this time it was the cellar.

37
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:05,230
What will it be next time?

38
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,040
Give up on him.

39
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,870
You and I

40
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:10,560
are the ones destined
to be together across lifetimes.

41
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,430
(He doesn't know.)

42
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,520
(Thank goodness.)

43
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,240
(In the last lifetime, Zhao Boqing)

44
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,470
(didn't kill him and seize the throne.)

45
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,840
(So the Crown Prince
knows nothing about it.)

46
00:02:19,470 --> 00:02:20,520
(Otherwise, in this lifetime,)

47
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,470
(he would never spare Zhao Boqing.)

48
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,120
Your Highness,

49
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:30,470
I need some time to think this through.

50
00:02:31,590 --> 00:02:32,400
All right.

51
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,280
I'll wait for you.

52
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,560
(The Crown Prince has his memories,)

53
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,470
(but knows nothing
about the plot to kill him.)

54
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:42,520
(Zhao Boqing has lost his memories,
yet wants to kill me.)

55
00:02:43,030 --> 00:02:45,120
(A cycle that shouldn't exist
has somehow begun.)

56
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,030
(What exactly)

57
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,430
(caused this lifetime to happen?)

58
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:00,470
What did you find?

59
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,430
I've searched through every text

60
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:04,840
and consulted
every mystic in the Capital.

61
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,280
There is no known form of sorcery

62
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:07,800
that can bind two people's lives

63
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,430
and make them share each other's pain,

64
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:10,400
much less

65
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,080
with such perfect synchronization.

66
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,190
Perfect synchronization?

67
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:16,080
It's far more than that.

68
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,870
In the cellar,

69
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,430
when the snake venom
left her unable to breathe,

70
00:03:19,430 --> 00:03:20,840
I couldn't breathe either.

71
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:21,470
Once she took the antidote

72
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,080
and could breathe again,

73
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,630
I could breathe normally as well.

74
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,590
When she bit her own hand,

75
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,800
the same injury

76
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:30,080
appeared on me too.

77
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,710
This...

78
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:34,000
is truly unheard of.

79
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,590
That's not all.

80
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:38,470
She was also
talking nonsense in the cellar,

81
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:39,800
saying something
about a previous lifetime.

82
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,030
She even said

83
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:44,800
your father was
an Imperial Preceptor named Zhixuan.

84
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:48,470
Your Highness,

85
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:49,750
my father died when I was young.

86
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,840
In life, he was merely
an editor at the Hanlin Academy

87
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:53,590
and never had any dealings
with the Imperial Observatory.

88
00:03:54,470 --> 00:03:55,280
Imperial Preceptor?

89
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,310
Since the founding of Great Yue,

90
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,870
such a position has never existed.

91
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:01,590
So how could there be
an Imperial Preceptor named Zhixuan?

92
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,960
That's what I don't understand either.

93
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,750
Your Highness,

94
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,430
this woman has been acting strangely

95
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:08,680
and is surrounded by mysteries.

96
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,840
If this shared pain

97
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,840
really is caused by her sorcery,

98
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,750
then I'm afraid

99
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,430
she must have an ulterior motive.

100
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:17,680
Whatever her purpose may be,

101
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:19,830
she has now become the greatest obstacle

102
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:20,870
in my fight for the throne.

103
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:22,360
I can't kill her,

104
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:24,560
nor can I let her keep spying on me

105
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,870
and interfering with my plans.

106
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:28,190
You mean...

107
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:30,950
I have plenty of ways to make her talk.

108
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,560
I'll find a way

109
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:35,830
to break this sorcery.

110
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:44,240
I told you to prepare the instruments.

111
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:46,240
What are you doing?

112
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,270
But hurting her
would mean hurting you too.

113
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:49,750
Your Highness.

114
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,360
So now you think

115
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,160
I've put some kind of spell on you?

116
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,360
If you don't explain everything today,

117
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,480
you're not leaving.

118
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,630
I can explain.

119
00:04:59,270 --> 00:05:00,660
But first, guess

120
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:02,600
which of these dishes are my favorites.

121
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,000
You...

122
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,270
If you get it wrong,

123
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:05,430
I won't tell you anything.

124
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,160
He Xiaoyuan.

125
00:05:13,270 --> 00:05:14,070
Fine.

126
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,000
This one.

127
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:18,390
This one.

128
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,310
And this one.

129
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,390
(Shrimp dumplings.)

130
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:21,300
(Almond pudding.)

131
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:21,990
(Lotus root with glutinous rice.)

132
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,000
(They were all my favorites
in the last lifetime.)

133
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:25,240
(His memories)

134
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:26,750
(may really still be there,)

135
00:05:27,310 --> 00:05:29,000
(just buried deep in his mind.)

136
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:34,390
I got them right, didn't I?

137
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,680
Now will you tell me?

138
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:37,680
Yes.

139
00:05:38,570 --> 00:05:39,340
But

140
00:05:40,260 --> 00:05:41,750
Study Companion Fu needs to leave first.

141
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,040
Yes.

142
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:55,560
Your Highness.

143
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,360
What I'm about to tell you

144
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,040
may sound utterly absurd,

145
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,750
but every word is true.

146
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,120
Go on.

147
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,390
You and I

148
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:06,750
have been bound together
through thirty-four lifetimes.

149
00:06:07,070 --> 00:06:08,830
You are the Pleiades, destined to rise,

150
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:10,430
and sooner or later,
you will rule the realm.

151
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:11,600
And I

152
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:13,000
am your companion star.

153
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:14,120
Our

154
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:15,480
fates are bound together.

155
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,480
To put Fu Yang in power,
Imperial Preceptor Zhixuan

156
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:23,070
used a secret art to alter
the course of the stars

157
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,070
and trapped us

158
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:25,830
in a cycle for thirty-three lifetimes.

159
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:26,950
It wasn't until the last lifetime

160
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,480
that we uncovered the conspiracy

161
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:31,040
and restored the stars
to their rightful paths.

162
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:32,240
But you died.

163
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:35,600
I thought the cycle would end,

164
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,040
but for some reason,

165
00:06:37,390 --> 00:06:38,390
it started again.

166
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:39,680
This time,

167
00:06:39,950 --> 00:06:41,040
you've lost your memories,

168
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:42,480
while the Crown Prince
remembers everything.

169
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,160
And now we even
share each other's injuries.

170
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:47,830
I think

171
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:50,040
this may be the will of heaven,

172
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,830
binding us together to keep the Pleiades

173
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:53,240
from harming its companion star.

174
00:07:02,430 --> 00:07:03,800
You don't even have a fever.

175
00:07:05,510 --> 00:07:06,430
I've already told you,

176
00:07:06,430 --> 00:07:08,480
Great Yue has never
had an Imperial Preceptor.

177
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,920
All these things you're saying
that make no sense to me

178
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:13,920
are just excuses
for your sorcery, aren't they?

179
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:14,830
Guards.

180
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:15,870
- Yes.
- Yes.

181
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,560
Lock her in the secret chamber.

182
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,870
Keep a close watch on her

183
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,240
and don't let word of this get out.

184
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,000
Wait.

185
00:07:23,190 --> 00:07:24,070
Wait.

186
00:07:27,030 --> 00:07:27,880
I have more proof.

187
00:07:37,270 --> 00:07:38,950
Then tell me something I can understand.

188
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,100
Under the name Mr. Chen,

189
00:07:42,110 --> 00:07:44,130
you've secretly been cultivating a group
of scholars from humble backgrounds.

190
00:07:44,130 --> 00:07:45,800
You've been secretly corresponding with
Wang Meng of the northern border

191
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,910
through private grain transport boats,

192
00:07:46,910 --> 00:07:48,480
with exchanges made on the fifteenth
and thirtieth of every month.

193
00:07:48,690 --> 00:07:50,090
And as for your
informants in the palace,

194
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:51,920
besides Nanny Wang,
Nanny Li, and Nanny Zhang,

195
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,430
- there are also...
- Enough!

196
00:07:59,430 --> 00:07:59,830
Your Highness.

197
00:08:00,190 --> 00:08:01,390
His Majesty has urgently summoned you
to the Imperial Study.

198
00:08:02,940 --> 00:08:04,780
I don't just know everything
that's happened between us.

199
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:07,180
I can even predict the future.

200
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:10,140
When you go to the Imperial Study,

201
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:11,290
you and the Crown Prince

202
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:13,340
will discuss the flooding in Huaibei

203
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:14,340
and disaster relief.

204
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:17,020
And outside the Imperial Study,

205
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,260
The Crown Prince

206
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:19,300
will trip over

207
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:21,060
a palace maid in orange serving tea

208
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:22,180
and cut the web of his hand.

209
00:08:23,260 --> 00:08:24,420
If it all comes true,

210
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:25,660
then you'll believe me.

211
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:28,060
Fine.

212
00:08:31,540 --> 00:08:32,420
Keep an eye on her.

213
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:33,420
Yes.

214
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:38,860
The floods in Huaibei

215
00:08:38,860 --> 00:08:39,900
have displaced tens of thousands.

216
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:41,220
As for the relief efforts,

217
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:42,500
I order the two of you

218
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,980
to oversee them together.

219
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:45,940
(The flooding in Huaibei.)

220
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,380
(She was right.)

221
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:48,540
Father,

222
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:49,820
my wedding is approaching,

223
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,020
and I fear I won't
have time to handle both.

224
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,260
As for the relief effort,

225
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:53,860
why not put Boqing fully in charge?

226
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:54,740
He can draw up a plan,

227
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:56,060
and I'll assist him as needed.

228
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:57,900
Boqing,

229
00:08:58,060 --> 00:08:59,260
what do you think?

230
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:01,460
I accept your command.

231
00:09:01,460 --> 00:09:03,260
I will do everything in my power

232
00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:04,420
to provide for the displaced people.

233
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:06,900
Father,

234
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,180
there is one more matter.

235
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:09,740
I've uncovered evidence
that for years, the Yu family

236
00:09:09,740 --> 00:09:10,660
has embezzled grain shipments

237
00:09:10,660 --> 00:09:12,180
and misappropriated
funds meant for river works.

238
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,380
The ledgers are here.

239
00:09:27,180 --> 00:09:28,100
The Yu family

240
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:30,380
dared to profit from a natural disaster?

241
00:09:30,460 --> 00:09:32,660
Crown Prince, thoroughly
investigate everyone involved.

242
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,780
Spare no one.

243
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:36,220
I accept your command.

244
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:38,780
I shall take my leave.

245
00:09:38,900 --> 00:09:40,820
(Imperial Study)

246
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:44,940
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

247
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:45,980
I deserve punishment.

248
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:47,260
(He tripped.)

249
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:48,220
(She's wearing orange.)

250
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:50,180
(The broken glass cup
cut the web of his hand.)

251
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,560
(She was right about everything again.)

252
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:53,300
(Could He Xiaoyuan
really be telling the truth?)

253
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:55,940
(Could she truly be my companion star,
destined to help me ascend the throne?)

254
00:09:56,140 --> 00:09:56,780
It's all right.

255
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:57,940
You may go.

256
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:01,500
Boqing.

257
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:03,580
The disaster relief cannot be delayed.

258
00:10:03,830 --> 00:10:05,380
Why don't we go to your palace now

259
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,380
and discuss the details together?

260
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:08,740
We can draw up a plan.

261
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:10,620
(He Xiaoyuan is still there.)

262
00:10:11,580 --> 00:10:12,380
That sounds good.

263
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:15,060
Yes.

264
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:16,980
Where are you going, Study Companion Fu?

265
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:20,100
Qingyan Palace is a little untidy.

266
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:21,020
I asked Fu Yang

267
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:21,700
to go

268
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:22,900
and have someone tidy it up.

269
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:24,220
We're brothers.

270
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:26,020
There's no need to tidy up for me.

271
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:27,500
Fu Yang.

272
00:10:27,820 --> 00:10:28,940
I remember

273
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:30,420
you're well versed in river works.

274
00:10:30,700 --> 00:10:31,900
For this disaster relief effort,

275
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:32,660
why don't you

276
00:10:33,260 --> 00:10:34,700
advise me on the matter?

277
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:40,900
(Has he)

278
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:42,820
(noticed something?)

279
00:10:52,300 --> 00:10:53,540
With you handling the matter,

280
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:55,220
I have every confidence in you.

281
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:57,420
Crown Prince?

282
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:05,500
Boqing.

283
00:11:06,260 --> 00:11:08,220
I'll be counting on you
to take care of this.

284
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:18,380
You have a guest here, Boqing?

285
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:19,380
No.

286
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:21,260
I was having
some refreshments by myself.

287
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:26,100
I remember

288
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:28,060
leaving a map
of the grain transport routes here.

289
00:11:28,620 --> 00:11:29,980
It should be in your bedchamber.

290
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:35,660
Your Highness.

291
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:40,100
Your Highness.

292
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:42,060
Your hand is injured.

293
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:43,300
You should have it bandaged first.

294
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:45,980
Hurry and tend
to the Crown Prince's wound.

295
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:48,260
Yes.

296
00:12:19,290 --> 00:12:21,610
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

297
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:23,650
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

298
00:12:24,290 --> 00:12:27,290
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

299
00:12:27,810 --> 00:12:32,130
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

300
00:12:32,130 --> 00:12:34,890
♪My heart has long known♪

301
00:12:35,330 --> 00:12:37,330
♪We made a promise long ago♪

302
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:39,250
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

303
00:12:39,930 --> 00:12:43,250
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

304
00:12:43,570 --> 00:12:46,410
♪How much must I let go♪

305
00:12:46,730 --> 00:12:48,410
♪For one moment♪

306
00:12:48,690 --> 00:12:51,410
♪To hold each other close♪

307
00:12:51,650 --> 00:12:55,970
♪Would that be enough?♪
